      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. one thing i was reading in some old clinical notes was about how different groups might have different responses to things like pain or how certain medications work. in terms of patient management, is there a difference in how i should approach pain assessment for black patients vs white patients? i heard something about tolerance levels being different and i want to make sure i don't misjudge someone during a physical.",
